#: ../userguides/open-data.rst:2 5be42f95f69b4b2394205327b9d5ecc9
msgid "Download Open Data"
msgstr "下载开放数据"

#: ../userguides/open-data.rst:4 dd74e28321ae4a2da6b1456d9fc812e0
msgid ""
"In Mapflow, you can download open mapping data from OpenStreetMap and "
"Overture Maps. This pipeline **does not use any AI model**. It is designed "
"to support your mapping projects with community-maintained open data."
msgstr ""
"在 Mapflow 中，您可以从 OpenStreetMap 和 Overture Maps "
"下载开放地图数据。该管道**不使用任何人工智能模型**。它旨在通过社区维护的开放数据支持您的测绘项目。"

#: ../userguides/open-data.rst:7 dc8a7b8093544085a495d6fa78d9ec94
msgid "Select one or more semantic classes and run the workflow."
msgstr "选择一个或多个语义类并运行工作流。"

#: ../userguides/open-data.rst:9 aadb95e31a50457da76052db7d58593a
msgid "**Run the pipeline**"
msgstr "**运行管道**"

#: 41a75f3d14444e56a37adfa9e439a737 abbcbc8a5d684e44b3675d01118a2315
msgid "Example result of the Open Data pipeline"
msgstr "开放数据管道的示例结果"

#: ../userguides/open-data.rst:17 ede15de5f0124f84a86ca56121554b3c
msgid "**Get the results and the image preview (in Web app or QGIS project)**"
msgstr "**获取结果和图像预览（在Web应用程序或QGIS项目中）**"

#: ../userguides/open-data.rst:26 05f87c412fa2435b8e898a2edcfe7b3c
msgid ""
"Results depend on the availability and completeness of open mapping data in "
"your area of interest. You can use it alongside AI-mapping results as a "
"complementary source."
msgstr "结果取决于您感兴趣的区域中开放地图数据的可用性和完整性。您可以将其与 AI 绘图结果一起用作补充来源。"

#: ../userguides/open-data.rst:29 8a8a40b509194c2090ad600bd2c3d431
msgid ""
"You have to select an image source the same way as for AI-mapping pipelines."
" Note that the results may not be well aligned with the image, because the "
"data comes from an external open data source. The image is provided only for"
" visual reference, so you can decide whether you need to apply edits or run "
"a Mapflow model to complement the results."
msgstr ""
"您必须以与 AI "
"映射管道相同的方式选择图像源。请注意，结果可能与图像不太一致，因为数据来自外部开放数据源。该图像仅供视觉参考，因此您可以决定是否需要应用编辑或运行 "
"Mapflow 模型来补充结果。"
